# What the build stage must not receive: installed modules (the image
# installs its own), build output (the image builds its own), the Rust
# engine's target directory, and local state. BuildKit reads this file
# because it sits beside the Dockerfile it is named after.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/target
**/.marfa-state
**/.marfa-drill
**/reports
data
_tmp
_local
_ignore
_trash
_archive
.claude
